; There is no notification within 72 hours. On 30 May, 5 days after
; activation, the controller notifies the authority, with the number of
; records affected and the reasons for the delay. The entry of 30 May is
; strictly after the deadline, 28 May 10:00, so the obligation is breached at
; the deadline; the same notification is in the cure window (28 May 10:00,
; 4 June 10:00], so the breach is cured (cure_restores): BREACHED, then CURE
; FULFILLED. The breach stays on record. The factor delay_reasons is only
; recorded; no verdict reads it.
(scenario gdpr_notified_day_5
  (spec "examples/core/gdpr_art33_notification.triel")
  (entry "2026-05-25T10:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-05-30T10:00:00Z" (act controller (notify (name authority)) must)
    (data (affected_records (int 1200))
          (delay_reasons (str "forensic analysis of the affected systems")))))
